      <p class="msc-section-kicker">Bitcoin Ecosystem</p>
      <h1>What Bitcoin Developers Do</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin development includes research, implementation, review, testing, security, wallets, Lightning, libraries, infrastructure, documentation, design, and maintenance. “Developer” is not one official job, and a repository role does not grant authority over Bitcoin’s consensus. The work becomes meaningful through evidence, review, release, voluntary deployment, and continued maintenance.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>People</li><li>Surface</li><li>Ecosystem Overview</li><li>22 to 26 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-26</li></ul>
